摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A deepseek harness plugin for tensorlake sandbox","id":"gh:1333773641","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-tensorlake-sandbox","slug":"tensorlakeai/dsh-tensorlake-sandbox","topics":["ai-agents","ai-infrastructure","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","harness","sandbox","sandbox-environment","tensorlake"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A deepseek harness plugin for tensorlake sandbox"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Tensorlake sandbox for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"`@tensorlakeai/dsh-sandbox` moves DeepSeek Harness file, subprocess, Bash, terminal, and LSP operati"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ons into one short-lived Tensorlake microVM. It is an installable dsh bundle and does not require ch"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"anges to the Harness installation."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Prerequisites"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- Node.js `^22.19.0` or `>=24.0.0`\n- `@deepseek-ai/dsh` `0.1.0-rc.6` or a later compatible release\n-"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" A Tensorlake project with `TENSORLAKE_API_KEY` set in the host environment\n- `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` set"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" in the host environment for the default DeepSeek model provider"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Keep credentials in environment variables or a secret manager; do not commit them to the profile or "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"tials in environment variables or a secret manager; do not commit them to the profile or repository."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Install dsh and add this bundle to the profile you run:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"During development, install a local checkout from its directory:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Use `dsh --profile headless --dump-config` to verify that the `@tensorlakeai/dsh-sandbox` layer disa"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"bles the host `subprocess` and `fs-sandbox` providers, inserts the Tensorlake runtime, subprocess, a"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"nd filesystem rows, and keeps `bash-sandbox` mounted in `danger-full-access` mode. In that mode Harn"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"ess's sandbox-aware Bash executor delegates directly to the Tensorlake subprocess provider while sti"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"ll satisfying the permission-preset capability contract."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Smoke test"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Run one headless task that exercises both the subprocess and filesystem providers:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"A successful run reports `/home/tl-user/workspace` from `pwd`, the `tl-user` identity from `id`, and"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" reads `hello` back from the file. The model-facing working directory is the same remote Linux path,"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" so the response should not mention or fall back from a host-machine path."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The bundle starts an ephemeral sandbox on profile boot and terminates it when dsh exits. The runtime"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" module accepts these Cordis config fields:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Each run prints the sandbox ID at both lifecycle boundaries. The IDs should match:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Field | Default | Meaning |\n|---|---:|---|\n| `apiKey` | `TENSORLAKE_API_KEY` | Tensorlake API cred"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ential used only by the host SDK |\n| `cwd` | `/home/tl-user/workspace` | Absolute Linux working dire"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ctory shared by file and process providers |\n| `timeoutSecs` | `600` | Sandbox inactivity timeout |\n"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"| `cpus` | Tensorlake default | Virtual CPU allocation |\n| `memoryMb` | Tensorlake default | Memory "},{"id":"p21s5","text":"allocation in MiB |\n| `diskMb` | Tensorlake default | Root disk allocation in MiB |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The shipped bundle derives both the runtime cwd and policy workspace from `DSH_TENSORLAKE_CWD`. Pref"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"er that single setting when changing the workspace so the Bash policy and remote providers cannot dr"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"hat single setting when changing the workspace so the Bash policy and remote providers cannot drift:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"To configure the rows directly in the profile's `cordis.patch.yml`, override both together. A patch "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"replaces the complete config, so restate every non-default field you need:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"`apiKey` is optional and should normally remain omitted. The package never copies `TENSORLAKE_API_KE"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"Y`, `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`, other credential-shaped environment variables, or `DSH_*` variables into san"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"dbox processes. A caller may still pass an explicit environment entry through a Harness tool or serv"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"es. A caller may still pass an explicit environment entry through a Harness tool or service request."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Runtime requirements"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The Tensorlake image must provide `bash`, Node.js, and GNU `base64`, `cat`, `chmod`, `env`, `find`, "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"`grep`, `ln`, `mkdir`, `mktemp`, `mv`, `ps`, `realpath`, `rm`, `stat`, and `tee`. The default manage"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"d Ubuntu image provides these tools. The runtime verifies that a configured cwd is writable and uses"},{"id":"p28s4","text":" the managed image's passwordless `sudo` to create and hand off a protected path when necessary."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The package targets `@deepseek-ai/dsh` `0.1.0-rc.6` or later compatible release. The dsh installatio"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"n supplies its optional Cordis, filesystem, subprocess, and Schemastery peers through the profile mo"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"dule fallback. The package uses only public `ctx.fs` and `ctx.subprocess` service definitions; no De"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"epSeek Harness source registration, generated catalogs, or in-repository configuration is required."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- `tensorlake@0.5.103`, the current SDK release, pins `undici@8.3.0` and `nanoid@3.3.11`; `npm audit"},{"id":"p31s2","text":" --omit=dev` reports high-severity advisories for those transitive versions. No audit-clean current "},{"id":"p31s3","text":"Tensorlake SDK release is available, so review the upstream advisories before production use and upd"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"ate the SDK pin when Tensorlake publishes one."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Develop"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The three Loader entry points are `@tensorlakeai/dsh-sandbox/runtime`, `@tensorlakeai/dsh-sandbox/fi"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"lesystem`, and `@tensorlakeai/dsh-sandbox/subprocess`. Each module default-exports its service class"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"; do not add function-plugin named exports to those modules because the Cordis Loader treats mixed e"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"xport forms as a function-plugin namespace."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
